                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does wedding season drive for jewelry D2C brands?</h3>
                                        <p>40-60% of annual revenue. Bridal jewelry + gifting jewelry + engagement + gold coins all concentrate.</p>
                                        <h3>When should wedding season planning start?</h3>
                                        <p>4-6 months before season for serious campaigns. Wedding buyers plan 3-6 months ahead — early presence wins.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I discount aggressively during wedding season?</h3>
                                        <p>No. Wedding buyers convert on brand + trust + design + reviews. Discount-heavy wedding marketing signals low-tier + loses to brand-heavy.</p>
